TV Cast  is a simple and powerful multifunctional screen casting app, just connect your device under the same Wi-Fi to cast the screen quickly.

Subscription:
1、Users can only use unlimited wireless screen casting, one-click screen casting and other functions after paying for a subscription;
2、The subscription fee will be deducted from the iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase, and the subscription is free to try for three days, and can be automatically renewed, and the renewal fee is ￥298/year;
3、Users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4、Auto-renewal of subscription Apple ID, will be 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle, automatically deducted from the iTunes account and extend the corresponding validity period;
5、Users manage their subscription services, i.e., after purchase, they can go to their user account to set up a way to turn off automatic subscriptions.

