Professional recording and recording to text software. The choice of millions of users to meet your recording needs in different scenarios!
Recording meetings? Presentations? Interviews? Classes? Evidence? Inspiration? ... . Or record your whole world?
[Ideal for the following people]
@Clerical - All kinds of meetings, one click recording to text, easy to handle meeting records;
@business - business negotiation, cooperation communication, the whole process is clearly recorded, easy to organize key information;
@Journalist - Record interviews and interviews with people on the spot, convert text while recording, and output scripts faster;
@StudentOne. The important points that you missed in class or couldn't remember in time, recording and transcription help you make up for it!
[Useful features to know early]
>Recording to text one supports instant audio and locally stored audio "enjoy" to text service
>Recording editing - support multi-selection and flexible editing
>Recording multiplier playback a adjustable playback speed, you can also listen to the recording while watching the text
>Recording cloud storage A support for confidential cloud storage, anti-loss, anti-mis-deletion



Recording expert VIP automatic subscription service description]
